{"id": "4387f2bf-9595-49a2-bc8a-9470c6e467ae", "slug": "meridian-geo-terrain-intelligence-platform", "title": "Meridian Geo — Terrain Intelligence Platform", "description": "Meridian Geo Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Meridian Geo — Terrain Intelligence Platform\"\ndescription: \"Meridian Geo Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#7A9A6E\"\n  secondary: \"#C4B99A\"\n  accent: \"#C4B99A\"\n  background: \"#0A0D08\"\n  surface: \"#C4B99A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"18px\"\n  control: \"17px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Meridian Geo — Terrain Intelligence Platform\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 114; favorites: 5; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, cta, bento, dither, charts.\n## Overview\nMeridian Geo Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nMeridian Geo Platform Surveys Analysis Research Request Access Terrain Intelligence Platform Map the earth in living detail High-resolution topographic analysis with real-time terrain modeling. From geological surveys t…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Map the earth in living detail.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #7A9A6E, secondary #C4B99A, accent #C4B99A, background #0A0D08, surface #C4B99A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Meridian Geo — Terrain Intelligence Platform</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"h-screen w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#0a0d08] text-[#c4b99a] font-sans antialiased selection:bg-[#7a9a6e]/30 selection:text-[#e8efe2]\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"heroCanvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 w-full h-full\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Ambient Gradient Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0a0d08]/60 via-transparent to-[#0a0d08]/90 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(122,154,110,0.05),transparent_50%)] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Interface -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-20 h-full flex flex-col w-full\">\n\n        <!-- Navigation -->\n        <nav id=\"nav-bar\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 md:px-12 md:py-6 backdrop-blur-xl bg-[#0a0d08]/30 border-b border-white/5 opacity-0\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer group\">\n                <span class=\"text-base font-normal tracking-tight text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#e8efe2] to-[#c4b99a] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:to-[#7a9a6e]\">\n                    Meridian Geo\n                </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-10\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a]/60 hover:text-[#e8efe2] transition-colors tracking-wide\">Platform</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a]/60 hover:text-[#e8efe2] transition-colors tracking-wide\">Surveys</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a]/60 hover:text-[#e8efe2] transition-colors tracking-wide\">Analysis</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a]/60 hover:text-[#e8efe2] transition-colors tracking-wide\">Research</a>\n            </div>\n\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden md:inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2 text-xs font-normal text-[#0a0d08] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#7a9a6e] to-[#5c7a4a] rounded-full hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(122,154,110,0.3)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-[1px]\">\n                Request Access\n            </a>\n\n            <!-- Mobile Menu Icon -->\n            <button class=\"md:hidden text-[#c4b99a] hover:text-[#e8efe2]\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- Hero Content Area -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-between w-full max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 relative\">\n\n            <!-- Left Column -->\n            <div class=\"max-w-[640px] flex flex-col z-20\" id=\"hero-content\">\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 opacity-0\" id=\"anim-label\">\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-[1px] bg-[#7a9a6e]\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-normal uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#7a9a6e]\">Terrain Intelligence Platform</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-thin tracking-tight text-[#e8efe2] leading-[1.05] mb-6 opacity-0\" id=\"anim-title\">\n                    Map the earth<br />\n                    <span class=\"font-extralight text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-br from-[#7a9a6e] to-[#a8c89a]\">in living detail</span>\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-light text-[#c4b99a]/70 leading-relaxed max-w-[480px] mb-10 opacity-0\" id=\"anim-sub\">\n                    High-resolution topographic analysis with real-time terrain modeling. From geological surveys to environmental monitoring, see the landscape breathe.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 mb-12 opacity-0\" id=\"anim-actions\">\n                    <!-- Premium Gradient Border Button -->\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl group overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-[200%] -top-[50%] bg-[conic-gradient(from_0deg,transparent_40%,#7a9a6e_60%,transparent_80%)] animate-spin opacity-40 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"animation-duration: 4s;\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-[1px] bg-[#0d100a] rounded-xl transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-[#0d100a]/80\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-xl shadow-[inset_0_0_20px_rgba(122,154,110,0.05)]\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"relative z-10 text-xs font-normal tracking-wide text-[#e8efe2]\">Explore the Platform</span>\n                    </a>\n\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a]/70 hover:text-[#c4b99a] transition-colors\">\n                        View field data\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stats -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/5 opacity-0\" id=\"anim-stats\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-[#e8efe2]\">2.4M km²</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a]/50 uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\">Terrain Mapped</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-[#e8efe2]\">0.3m</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a]/50 uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\">Resolution</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-[#e8efe2]\">147</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a]/50 uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\">Active Surveys</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Floating Card (Premium Surface) -->\n            <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute right-12 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-30 opacity-0\" id=\"anim-card\">\n                <!-- Gradient Border Wrapper -->\n                <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-[18px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#7a9a6e]/40 via-white/5 to-transparent shadow-[0_20px_60px_-10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]\">\n                    <!-- Inner Glass Card -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#0d100a]/80 backdrop-blur-2xl rounded-[17px] p-6 w-[260px] flex flex-col gap-5\">\n\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#7a9a6e] shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(122,154,110,0.6)]\" id=\"card-dot\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-[#e8efe2] tracking-wide\">Live Survey Feed</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3.5 w-full\">\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center w-full\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a]/60\">Elevation</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a] tabular-nums tracking-tight\" id=\"val-elev\">1,847m</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Custom Progress Bar -->\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-[3px] bg-white/5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n                                <div class=\"h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#5c7a4a] to-[#7a9a6e] rounded-full transition-all duration-700 ease-out\" style=\"width: 62%;\" id=\"val-bar\"></div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center w-full\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a]/60\">Gradient</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a] tabular-nums tracking-tight\" id=\"val-grad\">14.2°</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center w-full\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a]/60\">Contour Int.</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a] tabular-nums tracking-tight\">25m</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center w-full\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a]/60\">Layer</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#c4b99a] tracking-tight transition-opacity duration-300\" id=\"val-layer\">Bedrock</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Scroll Indicator -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 opacity-0 z-20\" id=\"anim-scroll\">\n            <span class=\"text-[0.6rem] font-light text-[#c4b99a]/40 uppercase tracking-[0.15em]\">Scroll</span>\n            <div class=\"w-[1px] h-8 bg-white/10 overflow-hidden relative\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1/2 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[#7a9a6e] to-transparent\" id=\"scroll-line\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // Entry & Ambient Animations using Web Animations API\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            const easeOutQuint = 'cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)';\n            const easeOutExpo = 'cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)';\n\n            // Initial Entry\n            document.getElementById('nav-bar').animate(\n                [{ opacity: 0, transform: 'translateY(-10px)' }, { opacity: 1, transform: 'translateY(0)' }],\n                { duration: 1000, easing: easeOutQuint, fill: 'forwards', delay: 100 }\n            );\n\n            const sequence = ['anim-label', 'anim-title', 'anim-sub', 'anim-actions', 'anim-stats'];\n            sequence.forEach((id, index) => {\n                const el = document.getElementById(id);\n                if(el) {\n                    el.animate(\n                        [{ opacity: 0, transform: 'translateY(15px)', filter: 'blur(4px)' }, { opacity: 1, transform: 'translateY(0)', filter: 'blur(0)' }],\n                        { duration: 1200, easing: easeOutExpo, fill: 'forwards', delay: 300 + (index * 120) }\n                    );\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Card Reveal\n            const card = document.getElementById('anim-card');\n            if(card) {\n                card.animate(\n                    [{ opacity: 0, transform: 'translateY(-50%) translateX(20px) scale(0.98)', filter: 'blur(10px)' },\n                     { opacity: 1, transform: 'translateY(-50%) translateX(0) scale(1)', filter: 'blur(0)' }],\n                    { duration: 1400, easing: easeOutExpo, fill: 'forwards', delay: 800 }\n                );\n            }\n\n            // Scroll Hint Entry\n            const scrollWrap = document.getElementById('anim-scroll');\n            if(scrollWrap) {\n                scrollWrap.animate(\n                    [{ opacity: 0 }, { opacity: 1 }],\n                    { duration: 1000, easing: 'linear', fill: 'forwards', delay: 1500 }\n                );\n            }\n\n            // Ambient Loops\n            const scrollLine = document.getElementById('scroll-line');\n            if(scrollLine) {\n                scrollLine.animate(\n                    [{ transform: 'translateY(-100%)' }, { transform: 'translateY(200%)' }],\n                    { duration: 2000, iterations: Infinity, easing: 'ease-in-out' }\n                );\n            }\n\n            const cardDot = document.getElementById('card-dot');\n            if(cardDot) {\n                cardDot.animate(\n                    [{ opacity: 0.4, transform: 'scale(0.8)' }, { opacity: 1, transform: 'scale(1.2)' }, { opacity: 0.4, transform: 'scale(0.8)' }],\n                    { duration: 2500, iterations: Infinity, easing: 'ease-in-out' }\n                );\n            }\n\n            // Data Simulation Logic\n            const layers = ['Bedrock', 'Sediment', 'Topsoil', 'Canopy', 'Surface'];\n            const elElev = document.getElementById('val-elev');\n            const elGrad = document.getElementById('val-grad');\n            const elLayer = document.getElementById('val-layer');\n            const elBar = document.getElementById('val-bar');\n\n            let currentElev = 1847;\n            let currentGrad = 14.2;\n\n            setInterval(() => {\n                currentElev += Math.round((Math.random() - 0.5) * 40);\n                currentElev = Math.max(400, Math.min(3200, currentElev));\n\n                currentGrad += (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2;\n                currentGrad = Math.max(2, Math.min(35, currentGrad));\n\n                if(elElev) elElev.textContent = currentElev.toLocaleString() + 'm';\n                if(elGrad) elGrad.textContent = currentGrad.toFixed(1) + '°';\n\n                if(elLayer && Math.random() > 0.7) {\n                    elLayer.style.opacity = '0.5';\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        elLayer.textContent = layers[Math.floor(Math.random() * layers.length)];\n                        elLayer.style.opacity = '1';\n                    }, 150);\n                }\n\n                if(elBar) {\n                    const pct = Math.round((currentElev / 3200) * 100);\n                    elBar.style.width = pct + '%';\n                }\n            }, 2000);\n        });\n\n        // WebGL Topo-Drift Shader\n        (function(){\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('heroCanvas');\n            const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl', { alpha: true, antialias: false, premultipliedAlpha: false });\n            if(!gl) return;\n\n            let mx = -0.5, my = -0.5, tmx = -0.5, tmy = -0.5;\n\n            function resize(){\n                const dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 1.5);\n                const W = canvas.parentElement.clientWidth;\n                const H = canvas.parentElement.clientHeight;\n                canvas.width = W * dpr;\n                canvas.height = H * dpr;\n                canvas.style.width = W + 'px';\n                canvas.style.height = H + 'px';\n                gl.viewport(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n            }\n\n            const VERT = `attribute vec2 p;void main(){gl_Position=vec4(p,0,1);}`;\n\n            const FRAG = `\n            precision highp float;\n            uniform float u_t;\n            uniform vec2 u_r;\n            uniform vec2 u_m;\n\n            vec3 mod289(vec3 x){return x-floor(x*(1./289.))*289.;}\n            vec4 mod289(vec4 x){return x-floor(x*(1./289.))*289.;}\n            vec4 perm(vec4 x){return mod289(((x*34.)+1.)*x);}\n            float snoise(vec3 v){\n                const vec2 C=vec2(1./6.,1./3.);\n                const vec4 D=vec4(0,.5,1,2);\n                vec3 i=floor(v+dot(v,C.yyy));\n                vec3 x0=v-i+dot(i,C.xxx);\n                vec3 g=step(x0.yzx,x0.xyz);vec3 l=1.-g;\n                vec3 i1=min(g,l.zxy);vec3 i2=max(g,l.zxy);\n                vec3 x1=x0-i1+C.xxx;vec3 x2=x0-i2+C.yyy;vec3 x3=x0-D.yyy;\n                i=mod289(i);\n                vec4 p=perm(perm(perm(i.z+vec4(0,i1.z,i2.z,1))+i.y+vec4(0,i1.y,i2.y,1))+i.x+vec4(0,i1.x,i2.x,1));\n                float n_=1./7.;vec3 ns=n_*D.wyz-D.xzx;\n                vec4 j=p-49.*floor(p*ns.z*ns.z);\n                vec4 x_=floor(j*ns.z);vec4 y_=floor(j-7.*x_);\n                vec4 x=x_*ns.x+ns.yyyy;vec4 y=y_*ns.x+ns.yyyy;\n                vec4 h=1.-abs(x)-abs(y);\n                vec4 b0=vec4(x.xy,y.xy);vec4 b1=vec4(x.zw,y.zw);\n                vec4 s0=floor(b0)*2.+1.;vec4 s1=floor(b1)*2.+1.;\n                vec4 sh=-step(h,vec4(0));\n                vec4 a0=b0.xzyw+s0.xzyw*sh.xxyy;vec4 a1=b1.xzyw+s1.xzyw*sh.zzww;\n                vec3 p0=vec3(a0.xy,h.x);vec3 p1=vec3(a0.zw,h.y);\n                vec3 p2=vec3(a1.xy,h.z);vec3 p3=vec3(a1.zw,h.w);\n                vec4 norm=1.79284291400159-.85373472095314*vec4(dot(p0,p0),dot(p1,p1),dot(p2,p2),dot(p3,p3));\n                p0*=norm.x;p1*=norm.y;p2*=norm.z;p3*=norm.w;\n                vec4 m=max(.6-vec4(dot(x0,x0),dot(x1,x1),dot(x2,x2),dot(x3,x3)),0.);\n                m=m*m;\n                return 42.*dot(m*m,vec4(dot(p0,x0),dot(p1,x1),dot(p2,x2),dot(p3,x3)));\n            }\n\n            float terrain(vec2 uv, float t){\n                float h = 0.0;\n                h += snoise(vec3(uv * 2.0, t * 0.014)) * 0.7;\n                h += snoise(vec3(uv * 3.5 + 5.3, t * 0.018 + 2.1)) * 0.4;\n                float warpX = snoise(vec3(uv * 1.8, t * 0.011 + 10.0)) * 0.18;\n                float warpY = snoise(vec3(uv * 1.8, t * 0.011 + 20.0)) * 0.18;\n                h += snoise(vec3((uv.x + warpX) * 2.8, (uv.y + warpY) * 2.8, t * 0.015)) * 0.3;\n                h += snoise(vec3(uv * 5.0 + 3.7, t * 0.022 + 7.0)) * 0.12;\n                vec2 mPos = u_m;\n                float mDist = length(uv - mPos);\n                h += exp(-mDist * mDist * 20.0) * 0.3;\n                h += exp(-mDist * mDist * 6.0) * 0.1;\n                return h;\n            }\n\n            void main(){\n                vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_r;\n                float aspect = u_r.x / u_r.y;\n                vec2 st = vec2(uv.x * aspect, uv.y);\n                float t = u_t;\n\n                float h = terrain(st, t);\n                h = h * 0.4 + 0.5;\n                h = clamp(h, 0.0, 1.0);\n                h = h < 0.5 ? h : 0.5 + (h - 0.5) * 0.85;\n\n                float levels = 20.0;\n                float scaled = h * levels;\n                float contourVal = fract(scaled);\n                float distToLine = min(contourVal, 1.0 - contourVal);\n                float line = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.0, 0.04, distToLine);\n\n                float majorLevels = levels / 5.0;\n                float majorScaled = h * majorLevels;\n                float majorFract = fract(majorScaled);\n                float majorDistToLine = min(majorFract, 1.0 - majorFract);\n                float majorLine = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.0, 0.07, majorDistToLine);\n\n                vec3 bgDark = vec3(0.04, 0.05, 0.03);\n                vec3 sageGreen = vec3(0.48, 0.60, 0.43);\n                vec3 oliveGreen = vec3(0.36, 0.48, 0.29);\n                vec3 fadedSage = vec3(0.25, 0.35, 0.20);\n                vec3 whitePeak = vec3(0.91, 0.94, 0.89);\n\n                float elevNorm = h;\n                vec3 fill = bgDark + vec3(0.01, 0.012, 0.008) * elevNorm;\n                float bandId = floor(scaled);\n                fill += vec3(0.004, 0.005, 0.003) * (sin(bandId * 2.3) * 0.5 + 0.5);\n\n                vec3 minorCol = mix(fadedSage * 0.5, sageGreen * 0.6, smoothstep(0.2, 0.5, elevNorm));\n                minorCol = mix(minorCol, sageGreen * 0.8, smoothstep(0.6, 0.85, elevNorm));\n\n                vec3 majorCol = mix(oliveGreen * 0.7, sageGreen, smoothstep(0.2, 0.5, elevNorm));\n                majorCol = mix(majorCol, whitePeak * 0.7, smoothstep(0.6, 0.9, elevNorm));\n\n                vec3 col = fill;\n                col = mix(col, minorCol, line * 0.8);\n                col = mix(col, majorCol, majorLine);\n\n                float majorGlowDist = min(majorFract, 1.0 - majorFract);\n                float majorGlow = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.0, 0.2, majorGlowDist);\n                col += sageGreen * 0.04 * majorGlow * smoothstep(0.3, 0.7, elevNorm);\n\n                float mDist = length(uv - u_m);\n                float mouseGlow = exp(-mDist * mDist * 12.0) * 0.15;\n                float lineNear = max(line * 0.5, majorLine * 0.8);\n                col += sageGreen * mouseGlow * (0.1 + lineNear * 0.3);\n                col += whitePeak * exp(-mDist * mDist * 40.0) * 0.04;\n\n                vec2 gridUV = st * 10.0;\n                float gridX = smoothstep(0.97, 1.0, fract(gridUV.x)) + smoothstep(0.03, 0.0, fract(gridUV.x));\n                float gridY = smoothstep(0.97, 1.0, fract(gridUV.y)) + smoothstep(0.03, 0.0, fract(gridUV.y));\n                float grid = clamp(gridX + gridY, 0.0, 1.0);\n                col += vec3(0.08, 0.10, 0.06) * grid * 0.05;\n\n                float vig = 1.0 - length((uv - 0.5) * vec2(1.1, 1.5));\n                vig = smoothstep(-0.1, 0.7, vig);\n                col *= mix(0.3, 1.0, vig);\n\n                float alpha = 0.9 * mix(0.4, 1.0, vig);\n                gl_FragColor = vec4(col, alpha);\n            }\n            `;\n\n            function compile(type, src){\n                const s = gl.createShader(type);\n                gl.shaderSource(s, src);\n                gl.compileShader(s);\n                return s;\n            }\n\n            const prog = gl.createProgram();\n            gl.attachShader(prog, compile(gl.VERTEX_SHADER, VERT));\n            gl.attachShader(prog, compile(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, FRAG));\n            gl.linkProgram(prog);\n            gl.useProgram(prog);\n\n            const buf = gl.createBuffer();\n            gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buf);\n            gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array([-1,-1,1,-1,-1,1,1,1]), gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n            const pLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(prog, 'p');\n            gl.enableVertexAttribArray(pLoc);\n            gl.vertexAttribPointer(pLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n\n            const u_t = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'u_t');\n            const u_r = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'u_r');\n            const u_m = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'u_m');\n\n            canvas.parentElement.addEventListener('mousemove', e => {\n                const r = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n                tmx = (e.clientX - r.left) / r.width;\n                tmy = 1.0 - (e.clientY - r.top) / r.height;\n            });\n\n            resize();\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n\n            function frame(t){\n                requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n                mx += (tmx - mx) * 0.05;\n                my += (tmy - my) * 0.05;\n                gl.clearColor(0, 0, 0, 0);\n                gl.clear(gl.COLOR_BUFFER_BIT);\n                gl.enable(gl.BLEND);\n                gl.blendFunc(gl.SRC_ALPHA, gl.ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA);\n                gl.useProgram(prog);\n                gl.uniform1f(u_t, t * 0.001);\n                gl.uniform2f(u_r, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n                gl.uniform2f(u_m, mx, my);\n                gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n            }\n            requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n        })();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "meridian-geo-terrain-intelligence-platform.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/meridian-geo-terrain-intelligence-platform.jpg", "source_name": "meridian-geo-terrain-intelligence-platform-DESIGN.md", "views": 301, "forks": 8, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T17:16:13.868722+00:00"}